  {
    "id": "features",
    "nome": "Servizi",
    "enabled": true,
    "html": "<section style=\"background:#ffffff;padding:5rem 1.5rem;border-top:1px solid #e4e2da\" id=\"features\" aria-labelledby=\"features-title\">\n  <div style=\"max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto 2.5rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:2rem;flex-wrap:wrap;border-bottom:1px solid #e4e2da;padding-bottom:1.75rem\">\n    <h2 id=\"features-title\" style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(1.9rem,3.2vw,2.6rem);color:#1c2024;margin:0\">Servizi</h2>\n    <p style=\"color:#767b80;font-size:1rem;max-width:32ch;margin:0\">Tre ambiti, un solo obiettivo: far crescere il tuo business.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"eext-2col-flat\" style=\"max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:0\">\n    <div class=\"eext-cell-r eext-cell-b\" style=\"padding:1.6rem 1.75rem;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e7e0;border-right:1px solid #e9e7e0;display:flex;gap:1.25rem;align-items:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;color:#a07a10;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;min-width:2rem\">01</span><div><h3 style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 .3rem\">Comunicazione</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:.9rem;color:#767b80;line-height:1.5\">Immagine coordinata, contenuti e strategie di comunicazione su misura per l'azienda.</p></div></div>\n    <div class=\"eext-cell-b\" style=\"padding:1.6rem 1.75rem;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e7e0;display:flex;gap:1.25rem;align-items:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;color:#a07a10;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;min-width:2rem\">02</span><div><h3 style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 .3rem\">Web Marketing</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:.9rem;color:#767b80;line-height:1.5\">Campagne e consulenze orientate al ROI, per una crescita costante e misurabile.</p></div></div>\n    <div class=\"eext-cell-r eext-cell-b\" style=\"padding:1.6rem 1.75rem;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e7e0;border-right:1px solid #e9e7e0;display:flex;gap:1.25rem;align-items:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;color:#a07a10;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;min-width:2rem\">03</span><div><h3 style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 .3rem\">Sviluppo piattaforme digitali</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:.9rem;color:#767b80;line-height:1.5\">Siti, e-commerce e applicativi su misura per privati e Pubblica Amministrazione.</p></div></div>\n    <div class=\"eext-cell-b\" style=\"padding:1.6rem 1.75rem;border-bottom:1px solid #e9e7e0;display:flex;gap:1.25rem;align-items:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;color:#a07a10;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;min-width:2rem\">04</span><div><h3 style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 .3rem\">Consulenza strategica</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:.9rem;color:#767b80;line-height:1.5\">Affianchiamo il management nella definizione di obiettivi concreti e misurabili.</p></div></div>\n    <div class=\"eext-cell-r\" style=\"padding:1.6rem 1.75rem;border-right:1px solid #e9e7e0;display:flex;gap:1.25rem;align-items:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;color:#a07a10;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;min-width:2rem\">05</span><div><h3 style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 .3rem\">Gestione Pubblica Amministrazione</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:.9rem;color:#767b80;line-height:1.5\">Esperienza consolidata nei progetti digitali per gli enti pubblici.</p></div></div>\n    <div style=\"padding:1.6rem 1.75rem;display:flex;gap:1.25rem;align-items:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;color:#a07a10;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;min-width:2rem\">06</span><div><h3 style=\"font-family:'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:#1c2024;margin:0 0 .3rem\">Brand identity</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:.9rem;color:#767b80;line-height:1.5\">Costruiamo un'identit&agrave; forte e coerente su tutti i canali.</p></div></div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
